items.summaryText:
“The others make the easy part easier. Vercel makes the hard part easy” – direct quote today from tech lead for AI agent platform built on https://t.co/nDDXqUmOlD at 55,000+ person company.

They wanted to have their company's all-knowing agent, like our @𝚟. Tried @aisdk, good but too low level. Tried off-the-shelf solutions and ${⁠lab} Enterprise products, expensive and inflexible. Tried agent frameworks, which led to the quote above… didn't hit the spot.

@evedev_ team cooked. It's hard to find the abstraction that's both easy and scales with sophistication.

items.summaryZh:
“其他工具让容易的部分更简单。Vercel 让困难的部分变得容易。”——今天一位来自 55,000+ 人公司、在 https://t.co/nDDXqUmOlD 上构建 AI Agent 平台的技术主管原话。

他们想要一个公司里无所不知的 Agent，就像我们的 @𝚟。试过 @aisdk，不错，但太底层了。试过现成的解决方案和 ${⁠lab} Enterprise 产品，昂贵且不灵活。试过 Agent 框架，于是有了上面那句引用……但没做到点子上。

@evedev_ 团队真的牛。很难找到一种既简单、又能随复杂度扩展的抽象。
